{"id":"a50c92c1fd28","html":"<div><div><p>You are here: <span><a href=\"https://austinkleon.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Blog</span></a></span> <span aria-label=\"breadcrumb separator\">/</span> <span><a href=\"https://austinkleon.com/category/miscellany/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Miscellany</span></a></span> <span aria-label=\"breadcrumb separator\">/</span> Inside the cartoon library</p>\n<p><time datetime=\"2026-09-30T12:27:28-04:00\">Wednesday, September 30, 2026</time>  </p><div><p><a href=\"https://austinkleon.substack.com/p/inside-the-billy-ireland-cartoon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://austinkleon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/https3A2F2Fsubstack-video.s3.amazonaws.com2Fvideo_upload2Fpost2F2178465852F1fa87abf-b4bb-4e66-80c4-46d1f728019c2Ftranscoded-07500-600x360.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"360\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n<p>Curators Jenny Robb and Caitlin McGurk took me on a 45-minute guided tour of one of my favorite places: the <a href=\"https://cartoons.osu.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Billy Ireland Cartoon Library &amp; Museum</a> on the OSU campus in Columbus, Ohio. Really fun. <a href=\"https://austinkleon.substack.com/p/inside-the-billy-ireland-cartoon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch the video</a>.</p>\n</div></div></div>"}